1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:51,130
2 years later

25
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:56,170
Rank 3 demonic energy is equivalent to Foundation Establishment.

26
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,290
10 times that is Core Formation.

27
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,410
If I extrapolate,

28
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,010
Soul Transformation requires rank 30 000.

29
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,970
I barely have enough celestial jades to reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

30
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,690
Using this demonic energy and converting it to celestial spiritual energy

31
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:15,490
is currently my best method to breakthrough to Ascendant.

32
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,850
In these 2 years,

33
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,610
the tribe has grown considerably.

34
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,770
It's really crowded now.

35
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:27,810
The souls within their Soul Flags need to be nurtured many times

36
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,810
to reach their full power.

37
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:33,850
Instead of teaching them how to nurture the souls,

38
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:37,490
I might as well put the Billion-Soul Flag here as a defensive formation.

39
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,330
Soul Refining Tribe,

40
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,650
release your souls into the black clouds

41
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,330
twice a day.

42
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,450
It will temper your souls.

43
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,770
Thank you, Ancestor,

44
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:56,210
for giving us this divine technique !

45
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:07,930
Brother Thirteen,

46
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:11,050
what does it feel like to cultivate the Soul Refining spell ?

47
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,890
Why do you ask him ?

48
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,210
He's crippled.

49
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,850
He doesn't even talk anymore.

50
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,490
Everyone, run ! There's a demon beast !

51
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,690
Everyone, run !

52
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,970
Run !

53
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,050
Run !

54
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,740
Brother Thirteen...

55
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,010
Ancestor,

56
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:01,490
when Thirteen was hunting,

57
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,290
he encountered a rare demon beast

58
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,370
By the time I arrived,

59
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,490
it was already too late.

60
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,690
I understand,

61
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,570
you may leave.

62
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,370
Let's go.

63
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,290
His meridians are shattered

64
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:26,050
but how could he have demonic energy of rank 2 ?

65
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:32,210
He forcibly absorbed demonic energy to store it inside his flesh.

66
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,490
It must have been excruciatingly painful

67
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,650
but he endured it for 2 whole years.

68
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,610
His determination is undeniable.

69
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,090
But with his meridians shattered,

70
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,810
the only thing that can save him now

71
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,090
is the Ancient God Tactic.

72
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,810
But this technique...

73
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,330
isn't something I can give so easily.

74
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,770
Thank you Ancestor, for saving my life !

75
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:10,610
You forcibly absorbed demonic energy.

76
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,650
Do you know the more you absorb,

77
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,130
the closer you are to death ?

78
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,570
Thirteen knows.

79
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,730
But I just thought that

80
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,090
by forcibly absorbing demonic energy,

81
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:21,890
I might still have a sliver of a chance to cultivate.

82
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,130
I don't want to be useless to the tribe

83
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,250
or to the Ancestor !

84
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:29,050
I can give you a body refining method

85
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:32,210
that will allow you to assimilate demonic energy into your flesh.

86
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,250
Although you won't be able to use spells,

87
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,770
your body will become stronger and stronger.

88
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,610
This body refining method is extremely painful.

89
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:42,250
If you mess up, even I might not be able to save you.

90
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,210
Can you withstand it ?

91
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,490
Thirteen

92
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:48,050
will definitely not let the Ancestor down !

93
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,730
I'm very familiar

94
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,210
with that look in his eyes...

95
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:05,290
If he can cultivate the Giant Demon Clan's body refining method,

96
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,290
I will teach him the first layer of the Ancient God Tactic.

97
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,770
It all depends on his fate.

98
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,570
We pay respects to the Ancestor.

99
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:19,490
This child is the one I mentioned before, Hu Pao.

100
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,370
He was born with rank 2 demonic energy.

101
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,210
In just a few short months,

102
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,930
he has already refined 13 Soul Flags.

103
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,170
Greetings, Ancestor.

104
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:27,570
Hu Pao
Soul Refining Tribe

105
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:32,090
Hu Pao has already cultivated the Soul Refining spell to the fourth stage

106
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,290
and I have 5 primary souls.

107
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,090
Ancestor, have a look.

108
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:51,090
Don't disrespect the Ancestor !

109
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:57,130
This child is extremely talented.

110
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,930
He might be even more talented than Red Butterfly.

111
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:03,210
If we let him grow freely within the tribe,

112
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,490
he might cause trouble in the future.

113
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,090
You will cultivate by my side.

114
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,490
Hu Pao pays respects to Master !

115
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:22,050
The Soul Refining Tribe is here !

116
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,250
Now surrender peacefully !

117
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,450
Those who lay down their arms

118
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,770
will be spared !

119
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,130
Soul Refining Tribe,

120
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,890
deploy our great formation !

121
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,730
The Holy Soul Refining Sect

122
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,650
shall live forever !

123
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,770
4 years ago,

124
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,370
I wasn't in a hurry to join Ancient Demon City's army

125
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:47,170
because I didn't have a foothold.

126
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:50,130
Now that the Soul Refining Tribe's influence is established,

127
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,730
it's time to leave.

128
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,050
From now on,

129
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,450
the Soul Refining Tribe will cease to expand.

130
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,850
You shall cultivate with all your might.

131
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,130
Ouyang Hua,

132
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,090
if the tribe encounters danger in the future,

133
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,130
use this jade slip to send me a message.

134
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,330
Junior will fulfill his duty !

135
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,650
We bid farewell to the Ancestor !

136
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,850
Ancient Demon City
Demon Spirit Land

137
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,130
Long time no see.

138
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,050
Let's go, let's go.

139
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,290
Where is the commander of this place ?

140
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,050
Where did those savages come from ?

141
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,690
The Commander is not someone you can meet like that !

142
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,650
Scram !

143
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,890
How dare you !

144
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,850
You dare to attack Ancient Demon City !?

145
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,410
Presumptuous !

146
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,730
That punch...

147
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,490
was wrong.

148
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,890
Thirteen was reckless.

149
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,610
But in my eyes,

150
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,850
anyone who disrespects the Ancestor

151
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,450
is an enemy.

152
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,850
I mean your punching technique was wrong.

153
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,210
You used all your strength but 40% of the power was lost

154
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,330
because you weren't able to control your heart.

155
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,250
With your current strength,

156
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,890
that demon soldier wouldn't have withstood the blow.

157
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,010
You're courting death !

158
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,690
Watch carefully

159
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,850
how I punch.

160
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,530
Although body refining is different from spells,

161
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,530
being in control is still the crux.

162
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:59,410
On the cultivation path, only the strong reign supreme.

163
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:00,050
Remember,

164
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,770
don't be belligerent

165
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,850
but never fear battle.

166
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,970
We pay respects to Commander Yao !

167
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,770
The Blood Ancestor's daughter...

168
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,850
This Yao Xixue always acts domineeringly.

169
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,410
She doesn't have good intentions.

170
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,850
Wang Lin,

171
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,570
I presume you've also come

172
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:29,610
to Ancient Demon City in order to gain military merits.

173
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,770
The Demon General ordered you

174
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,930
to follow me.

175
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,330
Given this woman's arrogance,

176
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,650
she wouldn't willingly relay messages like that.

177
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,050
The Demon General who defeated her

178
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,130
must be extraordinarily powerful.

179
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,890
Wait for me in the city.

180
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,250
Understood !

181
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:54,170
Left Wing Demon General's Manor
Ancient Demon City

182
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,330
Over 10 Soul Transformation cultivators

183
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,330
and many are at Late stage...

184
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,730
I saw in Luo Yun's memories that this Demon General

185
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,490
has subdued many Soul Transformation cultivators

186
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,490
and has never been defeated on the battlefield.

187
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:20,090
He must be a powerhouse who has reached Ascendant.

188
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,010
Your Excellency,

189
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,130
I have brought him here.

190
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:31,370
Mo Lihai
Left Wing Demon General
Rank 200 000 demonic energy
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

191
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,690
The foreigner that attacked my demon soldiers

192
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,490
outside the wall...

193
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,250
was it you !?

194
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,010
I was wrong.

195
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,450
This person's cultivation hasn't reached Ascendant.

196
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:43,090
If he's only Peak Late stage Soul Transformation.

197
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,490
Then how did he manage

198
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:47,250
to remain undefeated for thousands of years in the Demon Spirit Land

199
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:50,170
and subdue so many powerful cultivators ?

200
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,450
It was me.

201
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,690
Then let me see

202
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,770
what kind of skills you have !

203
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,330
Death Finger !

204
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,610
With this finger,

205
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:11,450
you can become an Elder of my manor.

206
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:15,370
Demon Spirit Land has inner and outer positions.

207
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:17,050
Only the outer positions like Commander

208
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,010
and Chief Commander

209
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,450
can command troops

210
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,210
and obtain military merits.

211
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,810
I don't want

212
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,290
an inner position.

213
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:28,130
You actually know the difference between inner and outer positions ?

214
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,890
As long as your strength is sufficient,

215
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:32,730
you foreigners can obtain any outer position.

216
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,330
But that finger from before...

217
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,970
is not enough !

218
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,530
You may continue.

219
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:52,770
It's this move...

220
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,050
It's coming.

221
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,970
This is my Ten Collapse Battle Intent.

222
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:58,490
If you withstand 8 collapses,

223
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,050
you will be a Commander.

224
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,090
Withstand them all

225
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,290
and you will be a Chief Commander !

226
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,890
First collapse,

227
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,930
Mountain Crusher !

228
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:13,130
How many collapses do you think he can take ?

229
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,890
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent can shake the world.

230
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:17,570
This person's strength is mediocre

231
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:20,050
so I think no more than 2 collapses.

232
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,330
Demonic Finger !

233
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,050
Such a powerful spell !

234
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,490
Second collapse,

235
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,530
Cloud Splitter !

236
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,730
This second collapse uses the momentum of the first one

237
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,050
to be 10 times stronger.

238
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,890
If I fought to the death,

239
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,450
I'd have to use the Underworld Finger or the God Slaying Chariot.

240
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,010
But there are many powerful experts here,

241
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,050
I can't play all my cards now.

242
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,010
If I can't face it head-on,

243
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,250
then I might as well attack

244
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,810
and seize the initiative.

245
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,330
Celestial Slaughter Art !

246
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,370
Very good !

247
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,970
Under my Battle Intent,

248
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,690
you're one of the few that fights back.

249
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:40,370
Let's see if you can break the remaining 8 collapses !

250
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,370
Third collapse,

251
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,690
Tide Breaker !

252
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,450
Another tenfold increase in strength...

253
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:54,090
how can he unleash spells that exceed his demonic energy cultivation !?

254
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,210
Impressive !

255
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,850
But it all ends here.

256
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,970
Fourth collapse...

257
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:22,970
Star Shatterer !

258
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,770
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent is extremely domineering.

259
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,050
With my cultivation,

260
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,450
I could only withstand up to the fifth collapse.

261
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,650
If it weren't for the artifact my father gave me,

262
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,690
I wouldn't have gotten the Commander position.

263
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,490
It's normal for Wang Lin

264
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,170
to give up here.

265
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:55,690
Resisting the fourth collapse is no easy feat.

266
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,170
Back down

267
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,730
and you can become an Elder.

268
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,850
Faith...

269
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,530
Your Ten Collapse Battle Intent

270
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:08,330
is a spell born from faith.

271
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,170
Interesting...

272
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,370
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent

273
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:15,130
doesn't come from his demonic power cultivation

274
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:18,090
but from his long-held faith in certain victory on the battlefield.

275
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,930
This move has defeated countless cultivators over thousands of years.

276
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,930
Each victory solidified his faith in victory,

277
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:28,970
ultimately creating this Ten Collapse Battle Intent with each collapse stronger than the last.

278
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:32,090
If he keeps winning with this faith in victory,

279
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:35,730
his Ten Collapse Battle Intent will continue to evolve

280
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,610
endlessly.

281
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,610
But since it's just faith,

282
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,850
then there is one thing I can use.

283
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,210
Demonic Finger...

284
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,770
Your Dao is fundamentally different from mine,

285
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:03,130
if you want to truly grasp the essence of the Demonic Finger,

286
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,450
you must transform into a demon.

287
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:16,130
You're the first to ever have a breakthrough during my Ten Collapse Battle Intent.

288
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,050
How interesting !

289
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,290
Let me see

290
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:22,050
how much progress you've made.

291
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,650
Fifth collapse,

292
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,250
Soul Turner !

293
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,810
Why is my Battle Intent

294
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:46,330
becoming unstable ?

295
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,210
I'm seizing your wisdom

296
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,290
to break your Dao.

297
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:56,370
Although your faith is strong,

298
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:59,090
my demonic thoughts can break it.

299
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,450
Sixth collapse,

300
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,490
Wheel Stopper !

301
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,930
The key to breaking your Ten Collapse Battle Intent

302
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,690
isn't cultivation

303
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,530
but a contest of faith !

304
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:32,770
Not bad !

305
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,570
I, Mo Lihai, have roamed battlefields

306
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,410
and been victorious for thousands years !

307
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:40,290
With what faith do you expect to defeat me ?

308
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,050
Seventh collapse,

309
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,250
Calamity Annihilation !

310
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,730
One finger...

311
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,650
to become a demon !

312
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:30,090
Mo Lihai...

313
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,450
was forced back !

314
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,330
So thrilling !

315
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:51,890
Wang Lin,

316
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,930
I really underestimated you !

317
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:57,090
Prepare for the last 3 collapses !

318
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,130
Let's see which one of us

319
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:01,490
has the strongest faith !

320
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,450
The demonic thoughts are too strong...

321
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:06,650
They nearly devoured my Dao Heart.

322
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,810
If I transform into a demon,

323
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:12,130
then even if I win, the loss would outweigh the gains.

324
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:14,690
Demon General,

325
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,250
I forfeit.

326
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,730
Such intense demonic thoughts

327
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:32,690
aren't even your true Dao Heart ?

328
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,770
You know when to retreat

329
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,650
and you understand when to make the right decision.

330
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:37,410
Good !

331
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,450
Although you didn't break the 10 collapses,

332
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:43,370
with your strength, you are qualified to become a Commander.

333
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:46,010
I appoint you today as Commander,

334
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:48,810
you will command 10 000 demon soldiers.

335
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,730
You can return to the city.

336
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,290
In 7 days,

337
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:55,290
someone will take you to your assigned barracks.

338
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,370
Thank you, General.

339
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:05,210
This person entered the manor as a nobody

340
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,530
with his Middle stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

341
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:11,250
but he was able to become a Commander all by himself...

342
00:21:16,420 --> 00:23:21,420
As the mosquito beast rushed across the sky, every tribe it passed activated their protection formation. In their eyes, the mosquito was simply too strong. It was already creating sonic booms just by flying across the sky. The thunderous roars it let out made it seem like thunder was descending upon the earth, creating an overall very shocking scene.

Before, when Wang Lin first entered the Demon Spirit Land, he didn’t know about the existence of the formations and tribes. The formations also had the ability to hide the people within, so he wasn’t able to find anyone. However, now he had a certain understanding of the Demon Spirit Land, so looking down now, he saw countless tribes.

There were strong and weak, large and small ones, and the population varied greatly between the tribes.

“If my Soul Refining Tribe can unite all of the tribes in the Demon Spirit Land, it will become a force that will even shock the nine countries here!” Wang Lin’s eyes became cold.

343
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:28,050
I've been walking this path for endless years

344
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:28,050
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

345
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:33,650
Is it the compass of fate

346
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:33,650
that wrote this outcome for us ?

347
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:39,570
The heavens want to erase your existence,

348
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:45,290
that's the obsession guiding me.

349
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:50,890
Is this the path to uncover

350
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:50,890
truths from falsehoods ?

351
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:56,490
In a world of murk and shadow,

352
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:56,490
only the flame of truth can light the way.

353
00:21:56,280 --> 00:22:02,210
Look at them all,

354
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:02,210
being carried by the waves.

355
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:06,850
Look at them all,

356
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:06,850
being drowned.

357
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:10,170
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

358
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:13,250
I will let the world refine my soul.

359
00:22:13,130 --> 00:22:18,810
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

360
00:22:14,820 --> 00:22:18,810
I will fight.

361
00:22:18,560 --> 00:22:21,930
I'll break through the abyss of despair

362
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:24,970
to finally learn who I really am.

363
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:30,330
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

364
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:30,330
I embrace this obsession.

365
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:33,290
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

366
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:36,090
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

367
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:41,570
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

368
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:41,570
I'll still fight.

369
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:44,930
It's hard to avoid loneliness

370
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:47,970
when you are above everyone else.

371
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:53,650
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

372
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:53,650
be afraid of a firefly ?
